  <name>Cosmic Cast Ext</name>
  <summary>Cast to Miracast wireless displays from the COSMIC Panel</summary>
  <description>
    <p>
      Cosmic Cast Ext is a COSMIC Panel applet for opening and monitoring a
      Miracast wireless display sender. It detects GNOME Network Displays from
      the system or Flatpak and provides quick controls for opening the display
      picker, refreshing runtime status, and closing the casting helper.
    </p>
  </description>
